  "field_semantics": "Within each originally filed SOXX common-stock schedule, take disclosed equity Security/Shares/Value rows. Divide each disclosed USD fair value by the sum of those equities; compute top five share and HHI. This is a lagged ETF reported-basket proxy, not official daily index concentration or SOXX return.",
  "fixed_parser": "For each frozen bounded section, parse direct HTML table rows from COMMON STOCKS heading through TOTAL COMMON STOCKS. Security row needs nonempty name and separate positive integer shares and USD fair value. Ignore sector headings and subtotal rows. TOTAL COMMON STOCKS may have amount in immediate following (Cost: ...) row. Fail on unparsed security-looking rows, duplicate names, row count outside 20-40, nonpositive values or sum differing from printed total by more than one USD. Do not change rows after seeing outcomes.",
